review_body:
This was my old review from June 2026;
I've always been pleased with the merchandise I've bought from here, I just look at the reviews before I buy and it's usually good. My biggest issue the last years has been that I've needed to pay customs even though I've payed taxes and Aliexpress has been a part of the VOEC, BUT for the last four packages that has changed for me and it has worked as before the mess. The only reason why my review is only a four star is because it's only been a short while, but if this continues over a longer time I'll change it to 5 stars. Glad Aliexpress has been taken care of the lack of reporting VOEC issue!

UPDATE! After buying a pair of sunglasses that came with a defect I now have to change my 4 star rating to a 2 because of incredibly bad customer service. Only reason why I don't change it to a 1 star rating is because what I previously wrote in this review still holds, which is a plus. But a case that should be an easy refund of the entire sum of approx 12 USD, Aliexpress customer's service says I have to return the glasses, pay a 30 USD return fee (which I only get a coupon code back for) to be able to get my entire refund. I even got a customer's support agent to send me to "the higher ups" but there i only got AI answers which just repeated the answers and didn't look into my case at all. I've spent at this point probably multiple thousands of USD on this site (luckily 98% has been good), but everytime somethings been wrong it rarely gets resolved. So buy at your own risk and don't except help or more than a small partial refund if something is wrong with it!
